# systemd 服务文件:让网站开机自启、崩溃自动重启
# 安装位置:/etc/systemd/system/english-learning.service
[Unit]
Description=English Learning FastAPI App
After=network.target

[Service]
# 工作目录和启动命令(路径按代码实际存放位置修改)
WorkingDirectory=/opt/english-learning
ExecStart=/opt/english-learning/.venv/bin/uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
# 意外退出后 3 秒自动重启
Restart=always
RestartSec=3

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
